093 nemotron-moe-triton-config: tuned M=1 Triton MoE config for Nemotron-3-Nano int4 w4a16 on RTX 3090

nemotron3-omni (QUANT=moe_wna16, E=128, per-rank intermediate 928, group 32, zero points, non-gated
relu2) ran fused_moe_kernel_gptq_awq on the upstream default config: no file exists for this shape.
Only the "1" key is tuned (decode at max_running 1); M >= 2 keeps the upstream default values so
prefill is unchanged. up: BLOCK_N 16 / BLOCK_K 256 / 4 warps / 2 stages; down: BLOCK_N 16 /
BLOCK_K 32 / 1 warp / 4 stages. Microbench 191 -> 127 us per fused_moe call.
nemotron3-omni tripwire, interleaved boots: 125.8 / 124.2 / 115.5 and 125.6 / 123.9 / 114.9
-> 151.3 / 148.6 / 136.1 and 151.1 / 148.4 / 135.9 tok/s at 1K / 32K / 262K. Greedy text and
logprobs identical on 5 prompts; MMLU 51/57, HumanEval 30/30, 256K reasoning probe 44 % both arms.
